| `pinneapple_analysis.trust.certificate` |  | verification as a service (#341): it takes somebody else's prediction and returns the certificate of what the physics says about it -- the residuals, the units, the boundary and positivity violations, the domain gate and, per check, the limit it was judged against and where that number came from. It is the judgement of a field a step already produced, like the trust record it embeds; a node here would have to be fed by the node that made the prediction, and would disagree with it |
